 "description": "Find variant candidates across six games, even without a current price. Returns stable tcg_ IDs, identifying fields, pricing availability and next_cursor. Use view=full to compare printed_number and finish_details. Preserve separate printings; choose an exact candidate before requesting prices. One admitted API call consumes one shared account request, including admitted errors. No automatic retries.",
